<title>JAPAN: Acom share trade bustles ahead of book-closing.</title>
<headline>Acom share trade bustles ahead of book-closing.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade of shares in Acom Co Ltd bustled in the Tuesday morning session due to selling by firms ahead of book-closings for the 1996/97 business year, brokers said.</p>
<p>As of 0133 GMT, the shares of the personal loan company were down 180 yen at 4,850 yen, making it the 12th largest percentage loser in the first section of the Tokyo bourse. It was the 10th most actively traded issue with volume of 2.03 million shares.</p>
